x\/SwiduxObservable","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/SwiduxReducer","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/SwiduxDispatcher","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Effect","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Send","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/cancellable(id:cancelInFlight:_:)","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/cancel(id:)"],"title":"Store","anchor":"Store"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/ChangeSet"],"title":"Data","anchor":"Data"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/StateWriter","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/UndoPlugin"],"title":"Persistence & Undo","anchor":"Persistence--Undo"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/KeyValueStore","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/KVKey","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/UserDefaultsKeyValueStore","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/InMemoryKeyValueStore"],"title":"Preferences","anchor":"Preferences"},{"title":"Plugin Protocol","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/SwiduxPlugin","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginHost"],"anchor":"Plugin-Protocol"},{"title":"Macros","anchor":"Macros","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Slice()","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Swidux()"]},{"title":"Type Aliases","anchor":"Type-Aliases","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddleware","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/UndoMiddleware"]},{"title":"Extended Modules","anchor":"Extended-Modules","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Foundation"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"Swidux-logo","type":"image"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swidux is a Redux-style state-management library for SwiftUI. State lives in one observable store, mutations go through reducers, and side effects run as async effects. Macros generate the observability boilerplate. Built-in plugins handle persistence and undo\/redo. Optional plugins ship ready-made paywalls (RevenueCat or StoreKit-shaped), version killswitches, parental gates, analytics (Mixpanel or any backend), feature flags, and SwiftData\/iCloud persistence."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The dispatch cycle:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["View → store.send(.action)","  → willReduce hooks (UndoPlugin snapshots here)","  → reducer mutates state in place, optionally returns Effect","  → plugin reducers handle their own actions","  → afterReduce hooks (PersistencePlugin drains EntityStore changelogs here)","  → observer tree updates only changed properties (per-property observation)","  → effects run on a background actor; results dispatch back via @MainActor send"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your domain types and database stay in your app. Swidux provides the contracts, observability, and dispatch loop."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Companion Packages","anchor":"Companion-Packages"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Vendor-specific adapters live in their own repositories so a third-party SDK never enters the core dependency graph. Each ships a drop-in service conformer plus a preview mock, and publishes its own DocC reference:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/"},{"type":"text","text":" — RevenueCat adapter for t